      "narrative": "Each diminished chord generates exactly four related dominant 7th chords, all interchangeable in cadential contexts. F# diminished generates D7, F7, Ab7, B7. The diminished chord is the organizational hub for a family of four V7 colors. Chapter 4, p. 83.",
