      "function_role": "vocalist-warmup-arpeggio",
      "narrative": "Harris defines the augmented arpeggio as a variant of the major arpeggio with the 5th raised a half-step: 'An Ab augmented arpeggio (the 5th degree is raised a half-step from the major).' It appears in the vocalist's warm-up series as a technical skill prerequisite for improvisation freedom. Chapter 5, p. 95.",
